OL,3,GNEWSA'I've caught one fish all season'
OL,4,A- how a polluted river could end 300
OL,5,Ayears of coracle fishing
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is a centuries-old tradition in
OL,8,FWales, but coracle fishers on a major
OL,9,Friver have said pollution has meant
OL,10,Fthere are "no fish" left.
OL,12,FTesting by campaign group Save the
OL,13,FRiver Tywi showed evidence of
OL,14,Findustrial, agricultural and human
OL,15,Fwaste pollution, with fishers saying
OL,16,Fthey often see dead fish bobbing up and
OL,17,Fdown in the water.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
