OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1787315158
OL,1,W5j 5Q5j 5w{j  wsjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I've caught one fish all season'
OL,4,A- how a polluted river could end 300
OL,5,Ayears of coracle fishing
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne fifth-generation coracle fisherman
OL,8,Fdescribed the situation in
OL,9,FCarmarthenshire as "dire" after only
OL,10,Fcatching one fish in the three-month
OL,11,Fseason between May and July.
OL,13,FNatural Resources Wales (NRW) said it
OL,14,Ftook all reports of pollution seriously
OL,15,Fand had "a number of ongoing
OL,16,Fenforcement and compliance
OL,17,Finvestigations within the Tywi
OL,18,Fcatchment".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
